  "notes": [
    "Built from the external/SPIRV-Tools and external/SPIRV-Headers submodule commits of DXC v1.9.2609 (= Vulkan SDK 1.4.363.0 tag). So spirv-val is the same version as the SPIR-V DXC produces.",
    "The libspirv.h C API (spvValidate and the like, plus the optimizer C API) is built as one shared library (SPIRV-Tools-c). The upstream shared build does not link on Windows because SPIRV-Tools-opt uses core's internal C++ symbols across the DLL boundary, so the two static libraries are compiled to export only the C API and bundled with whole-archive in a CMake wrapper (Build/SpirvToolsC.cmake). Upstream sources are not modified.",
    "There is no macos-arm64 output yet (Build.sh unverified)."
  ]
